!Sample_data_processing = Data pre-processing included a summarization and quantile normalization step to generate probe set level signal intensities for each microarray experiment and was performed as previously published by Liu WM et al. PQN and DQN: algorithms for expression microarrays. J.Theor.Biol. 2006;243:273-278.
